# The Starcage exiles Bot2's Ornithopter on turn 5. On turn 9 Bot1 activates {6}{W}{W} and, with the ability on the stack,
# sacrifices Haywire Mite to exile the Starcage: the Ornithopter comes back at once (CR 610.3). The ability then
# resolves with nothing exiled with the Starcage any more and no Starcage to sacrifice: no Robot is made and the
# Starcage stays in exile rather than going to the graveyard (it is no longer on the battlefield to be sacrificed,
# CR 400.7). The ability exists independently of its source (CR 113.7a).

